{"id":61607,"mal_id":61607,"title":"Shiguang Dailiren III","englishTitle":"Link Click Season 3","title_english":"Link Click Season 3","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["时光代理人 第三季 Part One","Shiguang Dailiren III Part One","时光代理人III Part One"],"en":"Link Click Season 3","ja":"时光代理人III"},"synopsis":"After the Li Tianchen incident came to a close, Time Photo Studio returned to a superficial peace. However, the news of Xia Fei's disappearance once again drew everyone into a crossroads of fate. With Vein's return and Qiao Ling's awakening of her superpowers, Cheng Xiaoshi and Lu Guang gradually uncover the secrets of the Bahati fire case, and Cheng Xiaoshi's father, Cheng Weimin, and mother, Shao Yuanyuan, also seem to have intricate connections to it. As the investigation deepens, Liu Xiao from a mysterious organization begins his operation, and the intervention of Yingdu police officer Jae further complicates this pursuit of the truth...\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)","synopsis_es":"Después de que el incidente de Li Tianchen llegó a su fin, Time Photo Studio volvió a una paz superficial. Sin embargo, la noticia de la desaparición de Xia Fei una vez más llevó a todos a una encrucijada del destino. Con el regreso de Vein y el despertar de sus superpoderes por parte de Qiao Ling, Cheng Xiaoshi y Lu Guang descubren gradualmente los secretos del caso del incendio de Bahati, y el padre de Cheng Xiaoshi, Cheng Weimin, y su madre, Shao Yuanyuan, también parecen tener conexiones intrincadas con él. A medida que la investigación se profundiza, Liu Xiao, de una misteriosa organización, comienza su operación, y la intervención del oficial de policía de Yingdu, Jae, complica aún más esta búsqueda de la verdad...\n\n(Fuente: Bilibili, traducido)","type":"ONA","media_type":"ona","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1459,"average_episode_duration":1459,"startDate":"2026-08-14","start_date":"2026-08-14","endDate":"2026-10-23","end_date":"2026-10-23","season":"